      "id": "claim_51c7334806c84fd18647e299155b804c",
      "statement": "Open SWE uses a separate MDA project to execute the `open-swe` graph’s model loop, checkpoints, and tool calls, while the backend plans each `agent`, `reviewer`, or `review-scout` run as a `ToolSurface` and exposes it as a typed API rather than compiling the graph.",
